OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFriday will get off to a grey
OL,6,Fand wet start with some locally heavy
OL,7,Fbursts of rain. The rain will ease and
OL,8,Fbecome more confined to southeastern
OL,9,Fareas in the afternoon, with a few
OL,10,Fbrighter breaks developing elsewhere.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FEastern areas will hold onto
OL,13,Fpatchy rain this evening, though clear
OL,14,Fintervals are likely further west.
OL,15,FOvernight, cloud will thicken as wet
OL,16,Fand rather blustery weather arrives
OL,17,Ffrom the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
